  "title": "Earnings 2024: Another Year of Above Market Growth as Content Portfolio to be Strengthened with Acquisition of IMG ARENA",
  "summary": "I’m very pleased with our performance in 2024, which marked a strong year of execution. The fourth quarter capped another consecutive year of above market growth and ahead of our already raised expectations. Company revenue for the full year reached a record €1.1 billion, 26% ahead of 2023, with all our product categories performing well,",
